# Check out text files with LF on every platform. Windows Git converts to CRLF by default, which changes
# byte offsets recorded in test fixtures (event logs, golden projections) and file sizes; the code reads LF
# everywhere. Binary files (detected by Git) are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
